@startuml
title IceFireDB Decentralized Database Infrastructure - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Redis Application" as RedisApp
actor "Redis Pub/Sub Application" as PubSubApp
actor "Deployment / PubSub Operator" as Operator

package "IceFireDB-Redis-Proxy" {
  component "Redis Command/Proxy Interface" as RedisProxyInterface
  component "Redis Command Category Support\n(String, Set, List, Hash,\nSorted Set, Stream, Control)" as RedisCmdCategories
  component "Decentralized Redis Agent Sync" as RedisSync
  component "Redis Storage Forwarding" as RedisForward
  component "Cluster-aware Proxy Routing" as ClusterRouting
}

package "IceFireDB-PubSub" {
  component "Redis Pub/Sub Protocol Interface" as PubSubInterface
  component "Decentralized Pub/Sub Engine" as PubSubEngine
  component "Peer Discovery & Routing\n(Kademlia DHT / libp2p-IPFS style)" as PeerDiscovery
  component "NAT/Private Network Communication" as NatComm
}

package "Internal SQL/MySQL Result Handling\n(SQLite-related, internal only)" {
  component "Packetized Result Parser" as SQLParser
  component "Field Metadata / Field-name Mapping" as SQLFields
  component "Rows, Warnings, Status Extraction" as SQLRows
}

database "Redis Standalone Storage" as RedisStandalone
database "Redis Cluster Storage" as RedisCluster

cloud "Decentralized Redis Agent Network" as RedisAgentNet
cloud "Decentralized P2P Pub/Sub Network\n(Same/Cross network, NAT/private)" as PubSubNet

component "Packetized SQL/MySQL Result Data" as SQLPackets

RedisApp --> RedisProxyInterface : Redis commands / application traffic
Operator --> RedisProxyInterface : configure / operate

RedisProxyInterface --> RedisCmdCategories
RedisProxyInterface --> RedisSync
RedisProxyInterface --> RedisForward
RedisProxyInterface --> ClusterRouting

RedisSync --> RedisAgentNet : synchronize Redis instructions
RedisAgentNet --> RedisSync : synchronized instructions
RedisForward --> RedisStandalone : write / read
RedisForward --> RedisCluster : write / read (cluster-aware)
ClusterRouting --> RedisCluster : cluster state / node changes
RedisCmdCategories ..> RedisForward : supported command forwarding

PubSubApp --> PubSubInterface : Redis publish / subscribe operations
Operator --> PubSubInterface : deploy / monitor

PubSubInterface --> PubSubEngine
PubSubEngine --> PeerDiscovery
PubSubEngine --> NatComm
PubSubEngine --> PubSubNet : publish / subscribe messages
PubSubNet --> PubSubEngine : message delivery
PeerDiscovery --> PubSubNet : peer discovery / routing data
NatComm --> PubSubNet : NAT/private-network communication

SQLParser --> SQLFields
SQLParser --> SQLRows
SQLParser ..> SQLPackets : parse packetized result data

note right of RedisProxyInterface
  Covers FR-001..FR-004, FR-010, FR-011
  Supports standalone and clustered Redis,
  decentralized Redis instruction sync,
  and Redis command category proxying.
end note

note right of PubSubEngine
  Covers FR-005..FR-009, NFR-002, NFR-004
  Redis-compatible publish/subscribe over
  a decentralized P2P network using
  Kademlia DHT with libp2p/IPFS-style routing (C-003).
end note

note bottom of SQLParser
  Internal data handling only; not a top-level
  product feature unless separately specified
  (C-005, C-006).
end note

@enduml
